// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P31586027" "Since you discovered the location where the Skulls are storing their caches of these new weapons, it is only right that the honor of taking those weapons from our enemies goes to you as well. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I have every confidence you will be able to capture this shipment of armaments before they hit the streets of the city.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P1163566552" "Capture the shipment of armaments before they hit the streets of the city"
// SendOffString :
"P2313981413" "You will need to defeat all of the foes protecting the warehouse where the weapons are being kept. The Skulls keep several of the doors locked at all times, so you will need to defeat guards to find keys in order to progress."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P579432983" "Defeat all foes in warehouse"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P255604129" "You will need to defeat all of the enemies present in that warehouse to prevent any of them from escaping with those weapons."

