// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - AnotherClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Description :
"P2695665806" "Find information"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1373088464" "One of the defeated Council soldiers had some information on him"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2599937532" "You defeated all of the Hellions, and found a clue on one of the Council Soldiers."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P217951615" "So, the Hellions were dealing with the Council. It's not quite absolute proof that the Council are the ones supplying these quantum array weapons, but it's close. From the information you found, it looks like they're running quality tests on a new shipment of these guns. That will be the next place to investigate."
// RandomFameString :
"P524985570" "I wasn't too sure about those Kheldian things at first, but I've seen the Peacebringers in action. Them, I trust."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL2_PeacebringerArc_Mission4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2083320025" "The information you found tells us that the council is testing a shipment of quantum array weapons that have just arrived in the city. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>This shipment must be intercepted, both to stem the flow of these weapons and to look for proof about who is producing them.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P1231887962" "Intercept the quantum array weapon shipment undergoing testing"
// SendOffString :
"P1949547406" "You need to secure the quantum array weapons in order to keep them out of the hands of our enemies. You'll also need to find and defeat a Dr. Rotheman, who's in charge of the weapon testing. Finally, you need to look for information about where these weapons are coming from, and if the Council is truly responsible."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2694401285" "Defeat Dr. Rotheman, his men"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3438043414" "These high-tech offices are nothing but a front for deadly Council operations."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_DISPLAYNAME 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P2235127092" "Dr. Rotheman"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_VILLAIN 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P383222867" "Very good. The tests should be done soon and we can send these on."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P457545189" "{HeroName}! Curse you Peacebringers! How did you find us?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Crates 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Description :
"P297681436" "crates of weapons"
// SingularDescription :
"P3700124114" "Find the last crate of weapons!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Computer 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P1914259378" "Lab Computer"
// InteractBeginString :
"P1169553929" "You access the computer"
// InteractCompleteString :
"P4099928398" "You finish accessing the computer"
// InteractActionString :
"P2096386660" "Accessing..."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4075916042" "You found some vital information on this computer"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1229213963" "You defeated Dr. Rotheman, secured the quantum array weapon shipment, and found out where the shipment was going to and coming from."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2333765828" "The information you found confirms it. These weapons were made on Striga Isle, the Council's stronghold. The Council are the ones behind the new weapons, but why? They already have the mercenary Void Hunters in their employ, so why would they need the quantum array weapons as well? Perhaps the answers can be found at the Council base those weapons were headed to."
// RandomFameString :
"P2328942125" "I saw one of those Void Hunter mercenaries working with the Circle of Thorns in a battle against Moonfire on the news. Those guys will work with anybody."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL2_PeacebringerArc_Mission5 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2268256503" "The next step will be to strike at the Council base the weapons you captured were intended to reach. We now know where the Quantum Array weapons are being manufactured and who is doing it, but there's still much we don't know. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>The only way to find out more will be to strike that base and scour it for information.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P1178966323" "Strike Council base and scour it for information"
// SendOffString :
"P1792746066" "You must secure the entire base, defeating all foes within it; as well as search for any information about the Council's programs against us. I know that you will succeed."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1451734399" "Defeat all Council in base"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P598321570" "Once you've secured that base by defeating all of the Council troops within it, you must still search for any information about the Council's plans against us. I know that you will succeed."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3122720513" "The outer defenses of this Council base were down, like they were waiting for a delivery of weapons that will never arrive."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_DISPLAYNAME 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P2748087399" "Colonel Hughes"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_VILLAIN 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3316178476" "If we warn other bases about {HeroName}, we'll take the fall for this fiasco. No, we stop that Peacebringer here."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2596505754" "You will not undermine my command!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Computer1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P3852824799" "Base Computer"
// Description :
"P4168336093" "pieces of information to find"
// SingularDescription :
"P2962984391" "Find further information"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1274536411" "You found some information on this computer"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Computer2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3334817515" "You secured the base and found several pieces of valuable information."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1142915356" "From the information you found, it seems that the Council is having some trouble manufacturing these Quantum Array guns. However, they still have the Void Hunter mercenaries. I have a suspicion that I can't confirm, but the answer may be waiting at the base controlled by this Colonel Zaus. Combined with what I already know, you may have found enough information to locate his lair."
// RandomFameString :
"P4261489451" "I'm still a little suspicious of the Kheldian's motives, but those Peacebringers and Warshades sure seem to be trying to help."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL2_PeacebringerArc_Mission6 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1050137032" "<A HREF={ACCEPT}>The Void Hunter base you discovered is your final target, {HeroName}</A>. Taking it out won't stop the Void Hunters, but it will set them back and at the same time help us to learn more about this enemy. <br>A word of warning, {HeroName}. I have good information that there is a <color red>Void Hunter</color> at that base, but he's not your goal. <color red>You will not need to defeat the Void Hunter to finish this. It may be better to avoid him if it's possible.</color> There's no need to fight a Void Hunter on his own ground when you can get the information we want by defeating Colonel Zaus."
// AcceptString :
"P3844514050" "Strike the Void Hunter base and defeat Colonel Zaus and his men."
// SendOffString :
"P2077539004" "Remember that your target is Colonel Zaus and his aides. The worst case scenario is that there will be a Void Hunter liaison on his staff, but I trust that you'll be able to handle any such situation."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2677459656" "Defeat Col. Zaus & his men"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1817846145" "Once Colonel Zaus is taken out, we should know a lot more about the Void Hunters."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3184705510" "Hidden deep beneath the streets, this Council base has been set up to support the Void Hunter Mercenaries."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_DISPLAYNAME 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P1237988740" "Void Stalker"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_VILLAIN 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P973069757" "Are you there, {HeroName}? The Kheldian in you is calling to me."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3595547485" "Is that Kheldian in you terrified, {HeroName}? It should be."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_DISPLAYNAME 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P3899900292" "Colonel Zaus"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_VILLAIN 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2401417658" "Don't worry. Our Void Hunters should be able to stop {HeroName} with ease."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P4185530592" "You won't win against me, {HeroName}! Zaus shall triumph! The Council shall triumph!"

