// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1621487285" "You have taken the Void Hunter support base, and captured it's commander."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4094755476" "Now we know. The Council is producing and distributing both the Quantum Array weapons and the Void Hunter mercenaries. The Quantum Array guns are bad enough, but what really worries me is the 'Nictus Fragment Integration' process they're using. That can't be good. It's a two pronged attack, pointed directly at the throat of every Kheldian not allied with the Council, and it's being masterminded by Arakhn herself. You have done very well in uncovering this, {HeroName}. Now that we are aware of our true enemy, I know that with Peacebringers like you rising through the ranks, we shall overcome any challenge the Council throws in our way."
// RandomFameString :
"P3356224763" "I don't care what the xenophobes and paranoids say. The Peacebringers have only helped this city. I trust them."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
